From: OmacVM
Subject: [PATCH] cocoa: hidden or background windows for tests

OMACVM_COCOA_HIDDEN=1 keeps the VM out of sight (no window, no Dock icon)
for tests that need the GPU but not the screen (video decode checks).
OMACVM_BACKGROUND=1 opens the window behind the others and never takes the
focus, for test runs while someone works at the Mac (Venus, GPU tests).
Neither is set by OmacVM.app.

Applies after omacvm-cocoa-displays.patch, which has its own test mode
(OMACVM_TEST_SKIP_DISPLAYS) at the same two places; this patch merges the
former qemu-cocoa-hidden-for-tests.patch and omacvm-cocoa-background.patch.
Upstream: not applicable (test switches).
Test: a VM started with each switch: no window / window behind, the
front app keeps the focus.

--- a/ui/cocoa.m
+++ b/ui/cocoa.m
@@ -1942,7 +1942,11 @@ - (id) init
             ? [NSString stringWithUTF8String:qemu_name]
             : @"QEMU"];
         [window setContentView:cocoaView];
-        if (omacvm_test_mode()) {
+        if (getenv("OMACVM_COCOA_HIDDEN")) {
+            [window orderOut:self];
+        } else if (getenv("OMACVM_BACKGROUND")) {
+            [window orderBack:self];
+        } else if (omacvm_test_mode()) {
             [window orderFront:self];   /* OmacVM test: never take the focus */
         } else {
             [window makeKeyAndOrderFront:self];
@@ -4298,13 +4302,17 @@ static void cocoa_display_init(DisplayState *ds, DisplayOptions *opts)
     // Pull this console process up to being a fully-fledged graphical
     // app with a menubar and Dock icon
     ProcessSerialNumber psn = { 0, kCurrentProcess };
-    if (!omacvm_test_mode()) {
+    /* OmacVM tests: OMACVM_COCOA_HIDDEN=1 keeps the VM out of sight (no
+     * window, no Dock icon) for tests that need the GPU but not the screen;
+     * OMACVM_BACKGROUND=1 opens the window behind the others, never active. */
+    bool background = getenv("OMACVM_COCOA_HIDDEN") || getenv("OMACVM_BACKGROUND");
+    if (!omacvm_test_mode() && !background) {
         TransformProcessType(&psn, kProcessTransformToForegroundApplication);
     }
 
     [[NSProcessInfo processInfo] setProcessName:omacvm_product_name()];
     [QemuApplication sharedApplication];
-    if (omacvm_test_mode()) {
+    if (omacvm_test_mode() || background) {
         /* OmacVM test: windows, but never the focus (the user works meanwhile). */
         [NSApp setActivationPolicy:NSApplicationActivationPolicyAccessory];
     }
